WEBVTT

01:35.940 --> 01:38.289
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.470 --> 01:41.229
[Episode 5]

02:20.360 --> 02:21.820
I'm leaving! I'm leaving!

02:26.750 --> 02:27.680
Look at the time.

02:29.079 --> 02:30.810
And you're just coming out now.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.750
You did your hair!

02:34.360 --> 02:35.630
Pretty handsome.

02:38.680 --> 02:39.210
Let's go.

02:44.520 --> 02:44.920
Get on.

02:47.750 --> 02:48.910
Sit tight and hold on tight.

02:48.910 --> 02:50.310
The road's really bumpy.

02:59.450 --> 02:59.870
[Luo Ningzi, here are
the scholarship application materials]

02:59.900 --> 03:00.330
[for those foreign music conservatories
you asked for.]

03:00.360 --> 03:00.620
[Take a look first.
If you have any questions,]

03:00.620 --> 03:00.890
[feel free to contact me anytime.]

03:00.890 --> 03:02.270
[Okay, thank you.]

03:14.960 --> 03:17.240
The first class is math.

03:25.630 --> 03:26.150
Lan,

03:26.630 --> 03:29.360
why have you been studying
so diligently lately?

03:29.520 --> 03:30.450
You've changed.

03:31.310 --> 03:32.960
It's senior year. I should study hard.

03:32.960 --> 03:35.890
If I don't study hard,
I won't be able to go to college.

03:36.190 --> 03:36.630
Alright, alright.

03:36.630 --> 03:37.360
Everyone!

03:38.079 --> 03:39.880
Stop what you're doing. Listen.

03:41.079 --> 03:43.140
Today is the first day of senior year.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.090
You've persevered for 2 years.

03:45.470 --> 03:46.600
For this final year,

03:46.960 --> 03:49.890
I hope you can
adjust your attitude towards studying

03:50.120 --> 03:52.120
and improve your study efficiency.

03:52.310 --> 03:53.120
Although

03:53.710 --> 03:55.590
life, like a math problem,

03:56.560 --> 03:58.079
shouldn't have only one solution,

03:58.079 --> 03:58.740
for you all,

03:59.190 --> 04:00.400
in the coming year,

04:01.120 --> 04:03.000
the college entrance exam
is your only option.

04:03.000 --> 04:04.000
So I hope you all

04:04.800 --> 04:05.750
can do your best.

04:06.430 --> 04:07.000
Okay?

04:07.150 --> 04:08.150
-Okay.
-Okay.

04:08.590 --> 04:09.990
Come on, open your books.

04:16.040 --> 04:16.720
Guys,

04:16.920 --> 04:19.480
this weekend
is Hailan University's open day.

04:19.480 --> 04:20.310
A one-day experience pass.

04:20.310 --> 04:21.040
Are you going?

04:21.040 --> 04:22.100
Hailan University

04:22.310 --> 04:24.840
has the best music department
in the country.

04:25.120 --> 04:25.720
I'm going.

04:25.830 --> 04:27.430
Hailan University's cello major

04:27.430 --> 04:28.160
is very famous.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.510
I'm going too. I'm going too.

04:29.510 --> 04:30.640
Ning, are you going?

04:31.190 --> 04:32.430
I'll check my schedule after I go back.

04:32.430 --> 04:33.270
If it works,

04:33.390 --> 04:34.320
I'll go with you.

04:34.480 --> 04:34.720
Mm.

04:35.830 --> 04:37.159
What about you, Xiaole?

04:37.190 --> 04:38.520
What about you, Xiaole?

04:40.630 --> 04:42.159
I'm not going.

04:48.830 --> 04:51.830
Didn't someone say he wasn't coming?

04:56.630 --> 04:57.870
The sun was too enthusiastic.

04:57.870 --> 04:59.130
He insisted I come out.

05:04.070 --> 05:04.510
Ning,

05:04.830 --> 05:06.160
recently, my parents and I

05:06.160 --> 05:08.390
have been talking about studying abroad.

05:08.390 --> 05:09.250
I want to ask...

05:10.190 --> 05:12.190
if you have any experience to share.

05:13.270 --> 05:14.430
There's a lot of information online.

05:14.430 --> 05:16.070
There are also
specialized agencies offline.

05:16.070 --> 05:17.470
You can go and ask around.

05:17.830 --> 05:19.830
Then recommend one to me.

05:20.070 --> 05:22.400
The one you choose is definitely the best.

05:22.630 --> 05:23.690
This kind of thing—

05:23.950 --> 05:26.270
the best isn't necessarily the right fit.

05:26.270 --> 05:28.200
You'd better look for it yourself.

05:29.310 --> 05:31.040
I'm going to Lan and the others.

05:36.750 --> 05:38.950
So big.

05:39.270 --> 05:41.070
There's even a tennis court.

05:41.190 --> 05:44.159
There must be lots of handsome guys
in the summer.

05:50.630 --> 05:51.760
Where are those two?

05:55.630 --> 05:56.830
What should I do, Xiaole?

05:56.830 --> 05:58.360
She seems to really hate me.

06:02.270 --> 06:04.510
You're so great. Why would she hate you?

06:05.270 --> 06:07.600
Besides, you sing really well, don't you?

06:21.060 --> 06:25.130
♪ Watching your profile draw near,
I smile like a fool ♪

06:25.730 --> 06:29.400
♪ Every word you said, like a melody,
sprouts in my heart ♪

06:30.210 --> 06:34.230
♪ The sparks between us
burn bright within the notes ♪

06:34.680 --> 06:38.530
♪ How I long for an answer from you ♪

06:38.860 --> 06:40.880
♪ My heart won't stop its racing beat ♪

06:41.320 --> 06:43.730
♪ The sweetness when our eyes meet ♪

06:42.920 --> 06:45.240
These two are pretty cool.

06:44.220 --> 06:47.890
♪ Each time we meet,
it's as if the dream goes on ♪

06:48.290 --> 06:50.480
♪ How I wish to tell you ♪

06:50.640 --> 06:52.860
♪ It's not a coincidence or a miracle ♪

06:54.930 --> 06:57.690
♪ It's destiny ♪

06:57.900 --> 06:59.750
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

06:59.770 --> 07:01.910
♪ Connecting you to my heartbeat ♪

07:01.970 --> 07:04.020
♪ Scrolling up and down the playlist ♪

07:04.110 --> 07:07.490
♪ Disrupting the rhythm of my breath ♪

07:07.700 --> 07:11.600
♪ On repeat, the song
tells the secret I can't speak ♪

07:11.710 --> 07:13.260
♪ The smile at the corner of your lips ♪

07:13.630 --> 07:16.600
♪ Makes me wonder ♪

07:16.680 --> 07:21.200
♪ If Cupid's golden arrow
has finally found you ♪

07:25.070 --> 07:27.190
Thank you. Thank you.

07:31.630 --> 07:33.240
Not bad, Xiaole.

07:33.310 --> 07:34.870
When did you get this good?

07:35.120 --> 07:36.000
Pretty cool.

07:37.310 --> 07:38.909
There's a lot you don't know.

07:40.600 --> 07:41.720
You sang really well.

07:41.720 --> 07:43.380
What do you think, Luo Ningzi?

07:48.190 --> 07:49.590
It indeed was quite good.

07:52.190 --> 07:53.480
I want to go to the library.

07:53.480 --> 07:54.740
Let's split up for now.

08:04.430 --> 08:05.870
It indeed was quite good.

08:07.720 --> 08:09.190
Let's start from this section.

08:07.820 --> 08:11.050
[Teacher's Music Room 2]

08:11.830 --> 08:13.560
Hand position, hand position.

08:13.950 --> 08:15.210
Move your hand up a bit.

08:16.750 --> 08:18.270
Yes, don't press too hard.

08:18.270 --> 08:18.800
Come.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.860
Give it some space.

08:36.289 --> 08:37.309
[Hailan University Journal]

08:38.909 --> 08:41.270
Ye Mei, Associate Professor of Cello,

08:41.600 --> 08:42.860
Doctoral Supervisor.

08:46.410 --> 08:47.930
[Verdant Campus]

08:47.950 --> 08:50.590
[Ye Mei: The moment you pick up the cello,
you must be devout.]

08:49.990 --> 08:52.450
Professor Ye is a big name
in the cello world.

08:52.910 --> 08:54.170
She's really amazing.

08:54.270 --> 08:56.600
She's trained so many champion students.

08:59.000 --> 08:59.390
Down.

08:59.360 --> 09:01.930
♪ She left in spring ♪

09:02.920 --> 09:05.800
♪ Gone with her was cherry blossoms ♪

09:06.480 --> 09:08.930
♪ On the once youthful face ♪

09:10.120 --> 09:12.800
♪ There were tears amidst confusion ♪

09:10.390 --> 09:12.790
This university even has a tea plantation.

09:13.680 --> 09:15.950
♪ She left in spring ♪

09:17.020 --> 09:19.630
♪ All was like a dream ♪

09:19.000 --> 09:19.400
Yi Lan!

09:19.460 --> 09:23.910
[Recording]

09:20.400 --> 09:23.170
♪ Youth never lasts ♪

09:24.580 --> 09:27.110
♪ Just let her go ♪

09:28.270 --> 09:29.120
Two turtles.

09:28.280 --> 09:30.470
♪ The paper plane that was once set free ♪

09:30.630 --> 09:34.030
♪ Will find its way back
to the old desk and chair at school ♪

09:34.240 --> 09:37.300
♪ All stories have yet to end ♪

09:37.700 --> 09:39.070
♪ Let me write for you ♪

09:39.130 --> 09:42.860
♪ An old CD will witness
our ever-ending dreams ♪

09:43.000 --> 09:43.870
I envy them so much.

09:43.070 --> 09:46.120
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

09:46.210 --> 09:49.400
♪ In which everyone has fun till the end ♪

09:49.430 --> 09:52.830
♪ It's a pity time always sneaks away ♪

09:49.630 --> 09:50.430
I've decided.

09:51.630 --> 09:53.750
I'm going to apply for the cello major
at Hailan University.

09:52.990 --> 09:55.420
♪ Leaving behind so many headaches ♪

09:54.270 --> 09:55.460
I want to become Professor Ye's student.

09:55.460 --> 09:57.050
♪ We never had the time to look back on ♪

09:55.870 --> 09:56.200
Okay.

09:57.260 --> 09:59.980
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

10:00.240 --> 10:03.150
♪ We live it wholeheartedly ♪

10:03.400 --> 10:07.040
♪ Joy and sorrow are woven together ♪

10:04.150 --> 10:04.630
Xiaole.

10:05.150 --> 10:06.390
I have a great idea.

10:07.270 --> 10:09.120
I don't think you have ideas.

10:07.350 --> 10:10.730
♪ Every experience will bring me closer ♪

10:10.030 --> 10:12.030
We should form a band together.

10:11.010 --> 10:13.450
♪ To myself ♪

10:12.240 --> 10:13.630
I've already thought of the band name.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.690
It's called Lefan.

10:17.870 --> 10:19.000
You play the guitar.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.150
And I'll sing songs.

10:20.270 --> 10:22.400
We'll be invincible, I'm telling you.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.440
-Lefan?
-Lefan?

10:24.240 --> 10:24.870
What?

10:24.870 --> 10:25.870
That's so cheesy!

10:27.240 --> 10:28.040
I support you!

10:28.510 --> 10:29.510
I support you too!

10:33.150 --> 10:35.360
Which universities do you guys
plan to apply to?

10:35.360 --> 10:37.000
Should we apply to the same one?

10:37.000 --> 10:38.240
I want to study abroad,

10:38.240 --> 10:39.790
but I'm worried I can't get admitted.

10:39.790 --> 10:40.670
But my dad said

10:40.790 --> 10:42.510
it doesn't matter
even if I can't get admitted. At worst,

10:42.510 --> 10:43.910
I'll just take over the family business.

10:43.910 --> 10:45.030
A rich kid indeed.

10:45.150 --> 10:48.510
If you can't get admitted,
you can only inherit the family business.

10:48.510 --> 10:50.890
Lan, which university
do you want to apply to?

10:50.890 --> 10:52.700
[Pre-filled College Application
Preference Form]

10:51.390 --> 10:52.600
Hailan University.

10:52.910 --> 10:53.870
But I checked.

10:54.390 --> 10:57.600
Hailan University's admission score
was 450 last year.

10:58.150 --> 11:00.550
The cello major only admitted 15 students.

11:00.670 --> 11:01.470
I'm thinking,

11:01.910 --> 11:03.570
even if I pass the school exam,

11:04.150 --> 11:06.270
I'm still under a lot of pressure
because of my academic scores.

11:06.270 --> 11:07.510
You can't think like that.

11:07.510 --> 11:08.510
We're not stupid.

11:09.270 --> 11:10.730
When did I say I was stupid?

11:12.270 --> 11:14.510
You're so talented in art.

11:14.790 --> 11:16.870
For the art exam, people usually
hire tutors for focused guidance.

11:16.870 --> 11:19.330
If you work hard,
you'll definitely make it.

11:21.270 --> 11:24.740
[Pre-filled College Application
Preference Form]

11:28.910 --> 11:29.840
I know who to ask.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.270
I think

11:33.510 --> 11:35.000
if you really want to learn,

11:35.000 --> 11:36.360
I'll introduce you

11:36.390 --> 11:37.790
to a professional tutor.

11:38.390 --> 11:39.120
How about it?

11:40.390 --> 11:41.630
I guess that works.

11:49.000 --> 11:49.360
Shan.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.850
Can I get admitted?

11:51.240 --> 11:53.870
Don't worry about that yet.
Human effort is the decisive factor.

11:53.870 --> 11:55.400
You have to work hard first.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.440
Do you want to...

12:01.000 --> 12:01.750
listen to...

12:02.150 --> 12:03.950
my mentor's, i.e. your mom's...

12:07.270 --> 12:08.670
wonderful performance.

12:09.360 --> 12:09.790
Yes.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.200
Let me see where it is.

12:15.030 --> 12:15.560
This one.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.000
My mom is amazing!

12:35.120 --> 12:37.050
She truly deserves to be my mentor.

12:37.120 --> 12:38.120
So professional.

12:40.510 --> 12:41.630
Why didn't you let me listen earlier?

12:41.630 --> 12:43.090
You didn't ask me earlier.

12:43.870 --> 12:44.800
My bad. I forgot.

12:47.270 --> 12:48.730
Since my mom is so amazing,

12:49.750 --> 12:51.120
I can definitely make it too.

12:51.120 --> 12:51.870
You definitely can.

12:51.870 --> 12:52.630
I believe in you.

12:52.630 --> 12:53.360
You can do it.

12:59.870 --> 13:00.670
You continue to listen.

13:00.670 --> 13:01.480
The books have arrived.

13:01.480 --> 13:02.410
I'll go get them.

13:02.630 --> 13:03.000
Okay.

13:11.600 --> 13:13.630
Stop reading and watch the shop for me.

13:13.630 --> 13:14.240
Got it.

13:22.750 --> 13:23.750
Tong Xiaole.

13:25.150 --> 13:26.750
Can you do something useful?

13:34.000 --> 13:34.750
I deduce

13:35.510 --> 13:36.640
that within 2 hours,

13:37.390 --> 13:39.590
no one will come. So I'll read a bit more.

13:42.150 --> 13:42.870
Ning!

13:44.510 --> 13:45.390
Mengmeng!

13:48.240 --> 13:50.000
Come and listen to my mom's performance.

13:50.000 --> 13:50.360
Come.

13:50.390 --> 13:50.870
Hurry.

13:50.870 --> 13:51.400
Sit. Sit.

13:51.630 --> 13:52.560
Listen. Listen.

13:54.870 --> 13:55.400
Chen Fan.

13:59.750 --> 14:00.360
Beg me.

14:07.870 --> 14:09.470
The first string, 4 fingers.

14:10.910 --> 14:12.570
The second string, 3 fingers.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.600
The third string.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.670
Back to the first string.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.790
Then to the second string.

14:18.790 --> 14:21.360
Your fingering is so nimble.

14:22.000 --> 14:24.060
With more practice, you can do it too.

14:27.670 --> 14:28.750
Let me show you.

14:29.120 --> 14:29.450
Okay.

15:09.270 --> 15:10.600
Professor Ye Mei?

15:15.150 --> 15:15.670
Hello.

15:16.790 --> 15:19.150
I'm Luo Ningzi,
a senior from No. 2 High School.

15:19.150 --> 15:21.240
Could you please comment on my playing?

15:21.240 --> 15:23.170
Your basic skills are quite solid.

15:24.270 --> 15:25.270
It's just that...

15:25.600 --> 15:26.930
it lacks some emotions.

15:28.390 --> 15:30.120
If you want to improve further,

15:30.150 --> 15:32.350
welcome to apply to Hailan University.

15:33.240 --> 15:33.840
Thank you.

15:34.390 --> 15:34.990
Keep it up.

16:07.270 --> 16:07.630
Shan.

16:07.630 --> 16:08.230
The books.

16:08.240 --> 16:09.700
Help me put the books back.

16:23.270 --> 16:24.070
Professor Ye.

16:26.670 --> 16:28.240
My name is Yi Lan.

16:28.480 --> 16:30.080
I'm Luo Ningzi's classmate.

16:30.630 --> 16:32.480
I also really want
to get admitted to Hailan University

16:32.480 --> 16:33.750
and become your student.

16:33.750 --> 16:35.010
I admire you very much.

16:35.270 --> 16:36.630
Show me your left hand.

16:37.870 --> 16:38.470
Left hand.

16:50.670 --> 16:52.070
Do you really like music,

16:52.360 --> 16:54.150
or do you just want to use this hobby

16:54.150 --> 16:55.150
to take the art exam

16:55.150 --> 16:57.550
as a stepping stone
to get into university?

17:00.720 --> 17:02.600
Music isn't a whim or a game.

17:03.630 --> 17:05.630
It requires you to work really hard.

17:05.960 --> 17:06.829
Are you ready?

17:32.200 --> 17:34.060
I'm going to my major class first.

17:36.400 --> 17:36.960
Ning.

17:37.830 --> 17:38.640
Your hand...

17:41.640 --> 17:42.440
It's nothing.

17:42.880 --> 17:43.880
The calluses have been rubbed raw.

17:43.880 --> 17:44.680
I'm used to it.

17:45.640 --> 17:46.100
I'm off.

17:48.110 --> 17:49.110
Ning, wait for me.

18:09.070 --> 18:09.480
Ning.

18:10.160 --> 18:12.220
Your performance just now was great.

18:15.920 --> 18:17.110
She said my playing

18:17.440 --> 18:18.440
lacked emotions.

18:19.400 --> 18:22.600
Professor Ye isn't necessarily right
about everything.

18:28.920 --> 18:30.250
I need to find emotions.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.650
I think it was full of emotions!

18:41.720 --> 18:43.640
Your dad's been busy outside these months.

18:43.640 --> 18:45.100
I've been pretty busy too.

18:45.110 --> 18:46.440
Just take good care of yourself

18:46.440 --> 18:47.770
and practice the cello.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.530
Here, have an apple.

18:50.880 --> 18:51.830
Mom, I...

18:52.550 --> 18:53.880
I know you don't like them,

18:53.880 --> 18:55.740
but they're good for your health.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.370
Thanks, Mom.

19:03.240 --> 19:03.550
Mom,

19:04.070 --> 19:06.200
I went to Hailan University last week.

19:06.440 --> 19:08.400
Their music program is pretty good.

19:08.400 --> 19:11.260
If my study abroad application
doesn't go through,

19:11.440 --> 19:13.170
I'll apply to this university.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.720
No matter how good Hailan University is,

19:15.720 --> 19:18.960
it still can't compare to going abroad
to polish your résumé.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.590
Don't worry about things at home.

19:20.590 --> 19:21.920
Just focus on yourself.

19:23.790 --> 19:24.310
Mm.

19:24.920 --> 19:25.550
Got it.

19:26.240 --> 19:27.700
I'm going to practice now.

19:38.640 --> 19:39.070
Mr. Bu.

19:39.480 --> 19:40.740
I understand all that.

19:41.240 --> 19:41.770
Yes, yes.

19:43.030 --> 19:44.890
We're always too busy out of town.

19:46.160 --> 19:46.880
Don't worry.

19:46.880 --> 19:49.210
We'll definitely communicate properly.

19:56.550 --> 19:58.610
What are you messing around with now?

19:59.240 --> 20:00.570
Photos taken by Xiaole.

20:07.440 --> 20:09.300
Your class teacher contacted me.

20:09.960 --> 20:11.590
He said your grades are very good,

20:11.590 --> 20:13.480
and the school has high hopes for you.

20:13.480 --> 20:16.340
I don't know much
about top universities or majors.

20:16.550 --> 20:17.880
What are your thoughts?

20:35.640 --> 20:37.170
Then just put down Finance.

20:38.790 --> 20:40.920
We never managed your studies before.

20:41.440 --> 20:43.100
But you're in senior year now.

20:43.440 --> 20:46.590
From now on, your mom will stay at home
and take good care of you.

20:46.590 --> 20:48.920
You just focus on preparing for the exams.

20:55.110 --> 20:55.400
I...

20:55.790 --> 20:57.790
These photos taken by Xiaole
are pretty good.

20:57.790 --> 20:58.440
Look, Tong.

20:58.440 --> 20:59.370
Just take a look.

21:00.640 --> 21:01.960
Take a good look.

21:05.310 --> 21:05.680
Mom.

21:07.350 --> 21:07.880
I'm fine.

21:09.310 --> 21:10.640
I can take good care of myself.

21:10.640 --> 21:11.840
I think at this stage,

21:13.110 --> 21:15.440
you two should just focus on making money.

21:22.720 --> 21:25.450
Xiaole, you really don't need me
to stay with you?

21:26.640 --> 21:30.100
Then I'll go on a business trip
with your dad tomorrow morning.

21:36.110 --> 21:36.480
Mom,

21:36.830 --> 21:37.400
I made plans with friends.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.530
I'm going out first.

21:40.550 --> 21:41.480
Come back early.

21:44.350 --> 21:45.590
Communicate properly?

21:45.590 --> 21:47.450
Do you think that kid will listen?

21:47.830 --> 21:50.160
He doesn't even know
how to respect us now.

21:50.550 --> 21:53.720
What's wrong? Shouldn't you
listen to our son's opinion on this?

21:53.720 --> 21:54.920
When filling out high school applications,

21:54.920 --> 21:56.160
you told me to let him do as he pleased.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.360
And he argued with me.

21:57.480 --> 21:59.240
Look at all his bad habits now.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.790
And he has such a bad temper!

22:00.790 --> 22:01.850
You're blaming me?

22:02.160 --> 22:03.560
Was it me who spoiled him?

22:03.640 --> 22:05.680
Neither of us usually has time
to discipline him!

22:05.680 --> 22:07.590
After just a few years of schooling,
he started looking down

22:07.590 --> 22:09.440
on his father for reeking of money, huh?

22:09.440 --> 22:10.830
Look at how listless he is!

22:10.830 --> 22:12.640
What can he possibly do in the future?

22:12.640 --> 22:15.550
Maybe I'll have to use my connections
to find him a job!

22:15.550 --> 22:16.880
Why are you always yelling?

22:16.880 --> 22:18.480
How are we supposed
to communicate like this?

22:18.480 --> 22:20.880
On the matter of filling out applications,
shouldn't you listen to his opinion?

22:20.880 --> 22:22.010
I can't believe you.

22:22.160 --> 22:24.830
You just never say anything nice.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.680
The cello major at Hailan University.

22:42.550 --> 22:43.200
Sister,

22:43.680 --> 22:46.240
if you get into the cello major,

22:46.830 --> 22:49.030
you'll become a musician in the future.

22:49.880 --> 22:51.680
Stop playing and come eat first.

22:57.440 --> 22:59.170
The tuition is a bit expensive,

22:59.240 --> 23:00.700
but I can work summer jobs.

23:00.790 --> 23:03.920
I can also work part-time in university
to earn tuition.

23:08.880 --> 23:10.080
It's not about money.

23:10.160 --> 23:10.960
I don't agree.

23:12.830 --> 23:13.290
Well...

23:16.350 --> 23:17.280
Let's eat first.

23:28.450 --> 23:30.300
[Bad news. My dad
doesn't agree with me learning the cello.]

23:30.300 --> 23:31.630
[Wait for me at the usual place.]

23:34.740 --> 23:39.310
[When the sun goes down,
it's time to drink]

23:37.300 --> 23:39.370
So? The place I found
is pretty good, right?

23:39.370 --> 23:41.070
Tonight was
our first successful performance.

23:41.070 --> 23:43.240
We must have a proper celebration feast.

23:43.240 --> 23:45.300
I'll treat you to barbecue. Let's go.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.880
I'm a bit tired today.

23:47.070 --> 23:48.000
Maybe next time.

23:48.240 --> 23:49.140
Next time, it's my treat.

23:49.140 --> 23:51.950
[When the sun goes down,
it's time to drink]

23:49.310 --> 23:50.370
I'm leaving first.

23:50.550 --> 23:51.070
Bye bye.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.790
You scared me.

24:26.880 --> 24:27.480
Tell me.

24:29.590 --> 24:30.920
Why did you come

24:31.960 --> 24:33.090
to your life mentor?

24:34.590 --> 24:36.400
Just those things about my dad.

24:37.550 --> 24:39.280
He always says the same things.

24:39.480 --> 24:40.160
He said

24:40.350 --> 24:41.640
he'll absolutely never support me

24:41.640 --> 24:43.300
in taking the cello as a major.

24:44.160 --> 24:46.110
He also said there's no future
in learning the cello.

24:46.110 --> 24:48.040
I asked him why, and he always said,

24:48.160 --> 24:50.400
"Eat first. That's enough."

24:56.480 --> 24:57.540
Do you think so too?

24:57.590 --> 24:58.250
Why would I?

24:59.160 --> 24:59.960
Of course not.

25:04.640 --> 25:05.240
But...

25:06.720 --> 25:07.550
have you put in the effort?

25:07.550 --> 25:08.240
Of course.

25:13.200 --> 25:15.160
It's just that
I haven't had professional training.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.890
So it's definitely not enough.

25:18.110 --> 25:19.240
Sometimes I'd think

25:19.720 --> 25:22.030
if I put in 100% effort

25:22.590 --> 25:24.590
and I still don't succeed in the end,

25:24.920 --> 25:27.350
my dad would surely be
very disappointed in me.

25:27.350 --> 25:29.350
I'd also lose confidence in myself.

25:30.790 --> 25:31.440
Fine.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.480
Let me ask you.

25:33.680 --> 25:36.240
You said you want to play the cello.
How badly do you want it?

25:36.240 --> 25:37.310
Even in my dreams.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.400
If it's something you dream about,

25:38.400 --> 25:39.310
just do it.

25:39.550 --> 25:40.240
If you don't get admitted this year,

25:40.240 --> 25:41.200
try again next year.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.640
Since it's something you dream about,

25:42.640 --> 25:44.110
how can you give up so easily?

25:44.110 --> 25:45.790
Something you dream about

25:46.200 --> 25:47.200
is called a dream.

25:48.440 --> 25:49.070
Dreams

25:49.830 --> 25:50.960
are very important.

26:00.880 --> 26:02.140
I can't give up easily.

26:04.400 --> 26:05.590
You're teachable.

26:08.400 --> 26:10.030
Then I need to plan properly

26:10.240 --> 26:11.500
how to convince my dad.

26:12.880 --> 26:13.740
What about you?

26:14.160 --> 26:16.160
Which university do you plan to apply to?

26:16.160 --> 26:17.400
I don't need to take the art exam.

26:17.400 --> 26:18.200
It's still early.

26:18.200 --> 26:19.640
You clearly don't know what to apply to,

26:19.640 --> 26:20.790
yet you're lecturing me.

26:20.790 --> 26:21.790
Stop pretending.

26:23.350 --> 26:24.830
I am maturer than you.

26:27.880 --> 26:28.740
How about this?

26:28.960 --> 26:31.830
You participate
in a photography competition

26:32.030 --> 26:33.890
or create a photography account.

26:33.960 --> 26:35.960
Maybe you'll become an instant hit.

26:38.310 --> 26:39.770
What are you "mm"-ing for?

26:39.830 --> 26:42.430
Why do you always refuse
to admit what you like?

26:47.590 --> 26:48.070
Oh.

26:49.590 --> 26:51.050
What are you "oh"-ing for?

26:53.880 --> 26:54.240
Sit.

26:54.790 --> 26:55.050
Sit.

27:00.070 --> 27:00.870
What's up, Bu?

27:01.640 --> 27:02.880
I know exactly

27:03.590 --> 27:04.650
what your level is.

27:05.400 --> 27:06.160
But...

27:06.290 --> 27:07.930
[Pre-filled College Application
Preference Form]

27:06.310 --> 27:07.880
this blank application form...

27:07.880 --> 27:08.210
What?

27:08.920 --> 27:12.250
Did you get yourself
a recommendation offer behind my back?

27:14.400 --> 27:15.460
I haven't decided.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.610
Is it that you haven't decided,

27:19.070 --> 27:20.880
or do your parents have other opinions?

27:20.880 --> 27:22.400
They're fine with whatever.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.790
I just haven't made up my mind.

27:23.790 --> 27:24.650
How about this?

27:25.400 --> 27:26.130
Your parents

27:26.310 --> 27:27.640
travel often for work, right?

27:27.640 --> 27:28.830
In the next couple of days,

27:28.830 --> 27:30.030
I'll pay them a visit.

27:30.590 --> 27:31.200
Let's talk

27:31.920 --> 27:33.780
about this properly face to face.

27:34.720 --> 27:35.380
Come. Come.

27:36.880 --> 27:37.480
What is it?

27:38.030 --> 27:39.630
I'm here to hand in homework.

27:39.640 --> 27:41.300
Okay, okay, just give it to me.

27:41.810 --> 27:43.390
[Pre-filled College Application
Preference Form]

27:42.160 --> 27:43.560
Alright, you can go back.

27:43.790 --> 27:44.590
What's wrong?

27:48.830 --> 27:50.640
I'm worried that you might

27:51.200 --> 27:52.330
pick the wrong major

27:52.480 --> 27:54.160
and end up at a not-so-good university.

27:54.160 --> 27:54.640
With your grades...

27:54.640 --> 27:55.310
It's about time.

27:55.310 --> 27:55.920
Class is about to start.

27:55.920 --> 27:56.830
I'm heading off.

27:56.830 --> 27:57.490
Okay. Okay.

27:58.070 --> 27:59.730
Remember to call your father!

28:18.640 --> 28:19.700
What are you doing?

28:23.880 --> 28:25.880
You really didn't
fill out your application form?

28:25.880 --> 28:27.810
Do you want to discuss it together?

28:28.110 --> 28:28.570
No need.

28:29.200 --> 28:29.680
No need?

28:30.640 --> 28:31.200
Really?

28:33.160 --> 28:34.070
Really?

28:35.200 --> 28:35.790
No need.

28:36.920 --> 28:37.350
Oh.

28:37.880 --> 28:38.480
Okay then.

28:39.880 --> 28:40.740
Suit yourself.

28:43.680 --> 28:44.880
Just remember,

28:45.590 --> 28:47.120
I'll always be on your side.

28:48.160 --> 28:49.360
If there's anything,

28:49.400 --> 28:50.460
come to me anytime.

28:56.640 --> 28:57.900
What's with that look?

29:10.760 --> 29:14.370
♪ The story begins with hand in hand ♪

29:15.440 --> 29:17.460
♪ For no reason at all ♪

29:17.620 --> 29:20.470
♪ I just want to walk with you ♪

29:21.300 --> 29:25.800
♪ Simply until we grow old ♪

29:26.510 --> 29:30.330
♪ Every warm touch that drew us closer ♪

29:30.900 --> 29:32.810
♪ Was nothing but a dream ♪

29:33.380 --> 29:36.820
♪ So many sunrises and sunsets ♪

29:37.120 --> 29:40.850
♪ Have changed our original hearts ♪

29:41.530 --> 29:45.030
♪ By not thinking about it or guessing ♪

29:45.220 --> 29:48.340
♪ I thought I could break free ♪

29:48.580 --> 29:55.500
♪ Time has shown
I'm not as carefree as I imagined ♪

29:54.720 --> 29:55.400
I'm going to be late!

29:55.400 --> 29:56.860
I'm leaving! I'm leaving!

29:57.020 --> 30:01.180
♪ I still can't forget the tenderness
you gave me that year ♪

30:01.270 --> 30:04.860
♪ Exhausting all my strength,
I still can't fool myself ♪

30:02.960 --> 30:04.490
He didn't wait for me again.

30:04.950 --> 30:08.300
♪ Your place is still here ♪

30:08.400 --> 30:12.780
♪ No one else can take it ♪

30:12.720 --> 30:13.830
Sorry, Sir.

30:12.840 --> 30:16.730
♪ Let me treat it as just a heavy rain ♪

30:14.110 --> 30:15.310
Hurry up and sit down.

30:16.790 --> 30:21.460
♪ Gradually, the memories we've built
become clear ♪

30:21.590 --> 30:26.250
♪ All composed into a song ♪

30:23.920 --> 30:25.120
Where is Tong Xiaole?

30:25.440 --> 30:26.440
He hasn't come yet.

30:26.440 --> 30:27.200
He hasn't come yet?

30:27.200 --> 30:30.460
♪ It's still so beautiful ♪

30:29.550 --> 30:30.750
Where is Tong Xiaole?

30:33.400 --> 30:34.830
I thought he had already come.
